@startuml
title UML State Chart Diagram - Video Suggestion System

[*] --> ReceiveRequest

state "Receive request" as ReceiveRequest
ReceiveRequest : entry / Waiting for video suggestion request
ReceiveRequest : do / Process incoming request
ReceiveRequest : exit / Request received

state IdentifyUser
IdentifyUser : entry / User makes request
IdentifyUser : do / Verify user identity
IdentifyUser : exit / User identified

state GatherVideos
GatherVideos : entry / User identified
GatherVideos : do / Search videos based on preferences, trends, tags, and genres
GatherVideos : exit / Videos gathered

state AddDetails
AddDetails : entry / Videos collected
AddDetails : do / Enrich with thumbnails and view counts
AddDetails : exit / Details added

state SendSuggestions
SendSuggestions : entry / Ready to send suggestions
SendSuggestions : do / Transmit suggested videos to user
SendSuggestions : exit / Suggestions sent

ReceiveRequest --> IdentifyUser
IdentifyUser --> GatherVideos
GatherVideos --> AddDetails
AddDetails --> SendSuggestions
SendSuggestions --> [*]

@enduml
